X:1
T:Nocturne Op. 15 No. 1
C:Frédéric Chopin
O:Nocturne in F major, Op. 15 No. 1
N:The first theme and its ornamented return (24 bars); the stormy middle section
N:is left out. Transposed down a fifth from F major to B-flat major, so the range
N:is D4 to G5. Notes from a Humdrum first-edition encoding (ifdo.ca, kern2abc) and
N:the flutetunes.com MIDI, which agree. Left out: the trills and the ornamental
N:run in bars 9 and 10, the grace-note runs before the A in bars 14 and 18 and the
N:grace notes in bars 9 and 19. The last bar stops after two beats, where the
N:next pass's pickup comes in. Chords simplified from the left hand.
M:3/4
Q:1/4=69
L:1/8
